                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">Track names — strips are numbered</div>
              
                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">A light theme</div>
              
                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">Effect reordering, or presets of any kind</div>
              
            </div>
          </div>
        
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;">
              <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.13em;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;background:#2A2418;color:#FFCB63;">NOT BUILT YET</div>
              <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.13em;color:#8A9099;">on the roadmap</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border-top:1px solid #23262C;">
              
                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">MIDI mapping and MIDI learn</div>
              
                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">First-party virtual instruments</div>
              
                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">Automation, or an input row in arrange</div>
              
                <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;">Marquee selection and batch region edits</div>
              
            </div>
