        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid #2C3038;border-radius:12px;background:#0F1114;padding:30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:#4CC9F0;">STEP TWO</div>
          <div style="font-size:21px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Buy a licence</div>
          <div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#8A9099;text-wrap:pretty;">Checkout runs on Polar. You get a licence key, trade it for your licence file, and keep the file — it never expires and moving Macs is copying it.</div>
          <div style="flex:1;min-height:8px;"></div>
          <!-- /loom/buy, for the reason written at the hero button above. -->
          <a href="/loom/buy" style="padding:14px 0;text-align:center;border-radius:8px;background:#171A1F;border:1px solid #2C3038;color:#E8EAED;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.09em;">BUY ON POLAR</a>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid #23262C;border-radius:12px;background:#0F1114;padding:30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:#8A9099;">REQUIREMENTS</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;">
            
              <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;">
                <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.13em;color:#8A9099;width:74px;flex:none;">MACOS</div>
                <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;flex:1;min-width:0;">13.3 Ventura or later</div>
              </div>
            
              <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;">
                <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.13em;color:#8A9099;width:74px;flex:none;">CHIP</div>
                <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;flex:1;min-width:0;">Apple Silicon only — no Intel build</div>
              </div>
            
              <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;">
                <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.13em;color:#8A9099;width:74px;flex:none;">AUDIO</div>
                <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#C7CDD4;flex:1;min-width:0;">An interface, or the Mac’s built-in input</div>
              </div>
            
              <div style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1A1D22;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;">
                <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.13em;color:#8A9099;width:74px;flex:none;">NETWORK</div>
